          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>• Ratings cluster tightly, and older decades still average higher than recent ones.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>• Runtime and era seem to matter more than genre.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>• Quality and quantity are different things: the most prolific directors aren&apos;t the highest rated.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
